      "id": "migrate-asymmetric-to-pqc",
      "summary": "Replace Shor-vulnerable public-key cryptography with NIST post-quantum standards.",
      "detail": "Plan migration of key establishment to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) and signatures to ML-DSA (FIPS 204) or SLH-DSA (FIPS 205), prioritising systems that protect long-lived data or perform key establishment over untrusted networks. Hybrid (classical + PQC) deployment is a common transitional step.\n",
